      },
      "lineNbr": 366,
      "author": {
        "id": 10415
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-02-16T04:31:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The key could just be put in the _id value and re-use the _id index that exists on every collection. This would eliminate the need for a 2nd index on \"key\".",
      "revId": "834afbb1bf242b7f4ea618ee71d9dcf54ad23744",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
