      "author": {
        "id": 10415
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-02-16T04:31:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand why you need to do a get and then a find_and_modify here. Seems like this whole function could be replicaed with a call to something like collection.update( { _id: key }, { $set: { value: value }}, upsert\u003dTrue ).",
      "revId": "834afbb1bf242b7f4ea618ee71d9dcf54ad23744",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
